      "control_id": "RA-3",
      "fedramp_parameters": "RA-3 (c) [security assessment report]\n\nRA-3 (d) [at least every three (3) years and when a significant change occurs]\n\nRA-3 (f) [at least every three (3) years]",
      "fedramp_requirements": "RA-3 Guidance: Significant change is defined in NIST Special Publication 800-37 Revision 2, Appendix F.\nRA-3 (e) Requirement: Include all Authorizing Officials."
